                <pb facs="0423" n="323" sameAs="frus:frus1920v03/pg323"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">834.156/9: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Paraguay</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Sussdorff</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1917-12-10T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 10,
                                1917—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>You are instructed to use your informal good offices with Paraguayan Government
                    to obtain an extension of the contract of the Construction and Engineering
                    Finance Company, which, owing to the war, has been unable to finance and obtain
                    material for construction of port and dock system.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
